Explanation:  
Functions used: str.strip(), str.title(), str.upper(), fillna(), drop_duplicates(), merge(), value_counts(), groupby(), sum()
Usage: str.strip() to clean spaces, str.title() to standardize event names, str.upper() to standardize departments, fillna() to replace missing dept, drop_duplicates() to remove repeated registrations, merge() to join with fees, value_counts() to count events, groupby() to group by dept, sum() to compute revenue

Interpretation: 
Without duplicate removal, the committee might wrongly believe CSE is the top contributor, while in reality ECE generates the highest revenue.
Removing duplicates ensures fair recognition of departments and accurate financial reporting.
